          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-ɣɛ̈dh-yaa gat Ɛ̈-ɣab a kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl kä Tha-mɛ-ria kɛ wäl bärɔw runi ruec Yɛ-ɣo-ca-pat kuäär Juda. Kä cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ run rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ la̱t ni jiäk waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial, cuɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni dup gua̱n, kɛnɛ dup man, kɛ duɔ̱p Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat, mëë jak I-thɛ-rɛl kä dui̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ pal ni kuoth Baal, Kä cuɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä gak kɛ dup diaal tëë ci gua̱n kɛ la̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
